  "description": "Create a generic file upload module that can be reused in any applications.\n        Provide the functionality to validate selected file, and upload it.\n        Upload destinations should be dynamic and configurable (Azure Blob, local folder, NAS drive).\n        Handle file synchronous and asynchronous uploads.\n        Large file upload in bytes.\n        Ensure validation for file format and size; both are configurable.\n        Make the component reusable for any developer by providing configuration.",
